    """ Return string containing ``chi**2/dof``, ``dof`` and ``Q`` from ``f``.

    Assumes ``f`` has attributes ``chi2``, ``dof`` and ``Q``. The
    logarithm of the Bayes factor will also be printed if ``f`` has
    attribute ``logGBF``.
